[
  {
    "type": 0,
    "content": "Farming Efaunt is a bit tedious so this is just a way to farm him in the most efficient way possible. \n\nOn the platform of his middle right arm, by throwing a Boomerang when the character sets foot anywhere within this dark spot and before it does a basic attack, we can break all 6 arms and have the shockwave from the basic attack be inside Efaunt head's hitbox. Now since the shockwave has a ~80% chance to proc, you may need to use shockwave slash or/and statue in case it fails.\n\n(The minimum required max talent of Mega Mongorang is lvl ~320)",
